        {
          "label": "A",
          "html": "10 ha"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "html": "100 a"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1000</mn><msup><mtext> m</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></math>"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mtext> km</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup></math>"
        }
      ],
      "figures": [],
      "answer": {
        "correct": null,
        "solution_html": null,
        "model": {
          "answer": "D",
          "by": "opus+sonnet",
          "agrees": null,
          "corroborated": true,
          "solution_html": "<p>Przeliczam na m²: A) 10 ha = 100 000 m², B) 100 a = 10 000 m², C) 1000 m², D) 1 km² = 1 000 000 m². Największy jest 1 km².</p>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
